  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5014.05 Additional Requirements. In addition to all other applicable requirements set forth in these rules, those transporting explosive materials, including display fireworks, over all highways shall comply with applicable requirements in 49 CFR 171 et seq.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; ss by #7481, eff 4-25-01, EXPIRED: 5-15-09\n\nNew. #9471, INTERIM, eff 5-15-09, EXPIRED: 11-11-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12738, eff 4-30-19",
